/* Purpose strings shown by iOS when MoMoEST asks for a protected resource.
   Keep them in sync with ios/Runner/Info.plist and with the other .lproj files. */

"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "MoMoEST uses the camera so you can answer a learning task with a photo, for example photographing the facade of the monument your teacher asks about. The camera opens only when you tap the button to take the photo, and the picture is sent to your class only after you confirm it. MoMoEST does not record video or audio.";

"NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription" = "MoMoEST uses your location to draw your position on the map, so you can see which learning places and itineraries are near you and walk to the next stop of an itinerary. Your location is used on this device only while the app is open: it is never uploaded to our servers nor shared with your teacher or classmates.";
